{"roles":null,"permissions":null,"success":true,"message":"","code":"200","data":{"appSearchResultBeanList":[{"category":{"iid":"6N89tbnrVTYIQK5jt7q3T","categoryName":"全部","cateLevel":2,"hasChildren":0,"ordernum":0,"matterMerge":0,"attachFlag":0,"dimensionResultBeans":null,"interfaceFlag":0,"interfaceId":"","showPageSize":0,"customParam":"","interfaceStyle":"","interfaceAppStyle":"","customParamFlag":0,"applyComputer":0,"applyMobile":0,"appIcon":"","fullMatch":0,"similarityPercentage":70},"mapSearchResult":{"total":1,"costTime":192.0,"items":[{"docId":0,"data":{"xxgktc":"10","filenumber":"","checktime":"1767888000000","sign":"JIRD","createdate":"1683734400000","title":"关于菜鸟北<em>路</em>、<em>云</em><em>联</em><em>路</em>道<em>路</em>通车的<em>通</em><em>告</em>","xxgkzt":"ZDZDJ00","xxgkindexcode":"002510856/2023-153639","webid":"3095","top":"0","feature":"3bb40acd4f985d9e7c141d5a092837ac","title_h":"关于菜鸟北路、云联路道路通车的通告","fbjg":"市公安局余杭区分局","vc_validate":"","attach_555004":"[]","regionname":"市公安局余杭区分局","vcnumber":"Y001-L001","bxxgk":"1","tag":"公告公示,其他业务公告公示","content_555003":"<p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">经建设单位申报，菜鸟北路、云联路道路已符合通车要求，将于近期开通运行。为确保开通后的道路交通有序、安全和畅通，公安机关交通管理部门根据《中华人民共和国道路交通安全法》、《道路交通安全违法行为处理程序规定》（公安部157号令）等法律法规相关规定有关规定，现将开通后交通组织措施及新增设的固定式交通技术监控点位通告如下：</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">一、道路基本信息：</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">云联路（凤新路——文二西路）段全长504米，为城市主干路，双向4车道，设计时速40km，沿线分别与凤新路、菜鸟北路、文二西路相交；菜鸟北路（云联路——数云路）段全长473米，为城市支路，双向4车道，设计时速30km，沿线分别与数云路、云联路相交。</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">二、开通时间：</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">云联路（凤新路——文二西路）、菜鸟北路（云联路——数云路）于2023年5月12日开通。</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">三、电子警察点位</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">云联路凤新路东口违法抓拍、云联路凤新路东口违法抓拍、云联路凤新路南口违法抓拍、数云路与菜鸟北路西口违法抓拍。电子警察点位（设备自公告之日起第30个自然日后开始启用）</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">上述道路开通后，全路段禁止停车，请行人、车辆按照交通信号和道路交通标志、标线标明的相关措施通行。</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\">特此通告。</p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\"><br/></p><p style=\\\"text-align: left; text-indent: 2em;\\\"><br/></p><p style=\\\"text-align: right; text-indent: 2em;\\\">杭州市公安局余杭区分局<span style=\\\"text-indent: 2em;\\\">交通警察大队</span></p><p style=\\\"text-align: right; text-indent: 2em;\\\">2023年5月11日</p><p><br/></p>","vc_wgkfl":"","xxgkfw":"qy99,gm99","author":"交通警察大队","betop":"0","module":"其他信息","vc_wgkflbm":"-100","webname":"杭州市余杭区人民政府","column":"1229175530","deploytime":"1683789827000","compaltedate":"1683734400000","url":"http://www.yuhang.gov.cn/art/2023/5/11/art_1229175530_4164198.html","metadataid":"918","websiteName":"余杭区","websiteid":"330110000000","title_str":"关于菜鸟北路、云联路道路通车的通告","titlepy":"guanyucainiaobeilu、yunlianludaolutongchedetonggao","able":"1","createdatetime":"1683789827000"},"pkValue":"JIRD_1229175530_4164198","groupCount":0,"groupValue":"","score":45672.645,"groupData":[],"similarRate":0.0,"tableName":"jsearch_database"}],"totalHits":1,"exception":null,"scrollId":null},"matterSearchResult":null,"attachSearchResult":null}]},"traceId":"e2b4c486bfdf4b3e98d27f939c23f66e","messageType":2}